WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.650
If you're not familiar with the inner workings
of the comic book world, there's a fair chance

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.660
there are more LGBTQ+ superheroes out there
than you realize.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:14.800
From the big screen to the small to the panels
themselves, here are some of the LGBTQ+ superheroes

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.680
out there saving the world for all of us.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:23.640
In 2017, the hit movie Thor: Ragnarok revitalized
the thunder god's franchise with a new brand

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.740
of irresistible humor and a huge gladiator
battle with the Hulk, of course.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.100
Among the new characters introduced in Ragnarok
was the tough, unapologetic binge drinker

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.600
Valkyrie, played by Tessa Thompson.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.960
She reprised the role as one of the leaders
of New Asgard in 2019's Avengers: Endgame,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.600
eventually being named leader of Asgard at
the end of the film.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:48.420
And fans will be seeing her again in 2021's
Thor: Love &amp; Thunder.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.760
"The Lord of Thunder sends his best.”

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.100
“The revolution has begun!"

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:01.360
Valkyrie's sexuality isn't addressed in the
theatrical versions of either Ragnarok or

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:06.210
Endgame, but shortly after Love &amp; Thunder
was announced at the 2019 San Diego Comic

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:13.720
Con, Marvel Studios confirmed Valkyrie would
be the MCU's first openly LGBTQ+ superhero

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.720
and that this would be addressed in the 2021
sequel.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:22.380
Thompson even said Valkyrie was bisexual as
early as 2017, lining the character up with

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.900
her comic book counterpart.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.719
Ragnarok had originally highlighted Valkyrie's
sexuality, but this scene was sadly left on

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:29.840
the cutting room floor.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:34.760
Unfortunately, the comic book version of Valkyrie
on which Thompson's character is based is

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.040
no longer around.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:42.280
That hero, Brunnhilde, was killed by the dark
elf Malekith in the line-wide event War of

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.280
the Realms.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.220
The role of Valkyrie has since been taken
up by Jane Foster, who Natalie Portman portrayed

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:53.960
in the first two Thor films and who is also
set to appear in Love &amp; Thunder, as Thor herself.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:59.940
In the comics it's no secret that Wade Wilson,
also known as Deadpool, is pansexual.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.320
Longtime Deadpool writer Gerry Duggan has
gone on record as saying the Merc with a Mouth

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.320
sets his romantic boundaries at "anything
with a pulse."

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:13.690
So far, that hasn't really been reflected
in his big-screen appearances, though Deadpool

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:18.440
2 certainly ramps up Wade's fixation on the
ironclad mutant Colossus.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:23.340
Since Ryan Reynolds has confirmed as much,
it seems that Deadpool's new owners over at

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:26.080
Disney are working on a new movie featuring
the character.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:31.540
And if we do get a Deadpool 3, there's a fair
chance Wade Wilson's pansexuality will be

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.780
expressed more explicitly in the films.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:38.640
Reynolds himself has even said that he wants
to see that side of Wade come out more on

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.560
the big screen.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.920
At the 2018 San Diego Comic Con, the actor
said one of the things he loves about the

00:02:44.939 --> 00:02:50.200
Deadpool films is that they can go places
other superhero movies can't or won't, and

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:56.489
he suggested LGBTQ+ representation as one
of those places adding that he specifically

00:02:56.489 --> 00:02:58.340
wanted to explore that through Wade.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:03.380
Marvel Studios has made some truly unforgettable
superhero films in the past decade.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:09.440
And while opinions will always vary, the uneven
quality of the X-Men franchise and the failure

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:14.560
of the last couple of Fantastic Four movies
meant that a lot of fans were very happy when

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.040
Disney acquired Fox Studios in 2019.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.840
Still, there's at least one important landmark
the Fox films hit before Marvel producing

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.660
a movie featuring Marvel's first on-screen
same-sex couple.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:31.760
In 2018's Deadpool 2, it's revealed that Negasonic
Teenage Warhead is in a relationship with

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.260
a young X-Men member named Yukio.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:38.740
Not a lot is shown of their relationship,
but the duo joins Wade and the rest of the

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.300
heroes in the film's climax.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:45.450
The pair appear just in time to save Colossus
from Juggernaut, and later contribute to the

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.560
latter's less-than-pleasant fate.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:53.579
Curtis Holt, played by Echo Kellum, has been
an openly gay man since his first appearance

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.460
on CW's Arrow but he wasn't always a superhero.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:02.240
Holt has appeared regularly on Arrow since
its fourth season, though initially he was

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:07.629
content to be the "guy in the chair," coordinating
things from Oliver Queen's "Arrowcave," and

00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:10.760
generally hacking into whatever needed to
be hacked into.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:15.600
But after he is attacked by street thugs in
the show's fifth season, Curtis asks Oliver

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.860
to train him for some more hands-on work.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:23.110
Borrowing the ring name of his favorite wrestler
and using his ingenious gadgets to help fight

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.480
crime, Holt becomes Mr. Terrific.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.600
But Holt's time as a vigilante doesn't come
without cost.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:34.000
Later in Arrow's fifth season, Curtis' husband
Paul leaves him after discovering his hidden

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.000
crime-fighting life.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:40.380
Fortunately, love finds Curitis once more
in the form of Star City police officer Nick

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.060
Anastas.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:46.360
Holt has since given up crime-fighting, but
still helps Team Arrow in a guy-in-the-chair

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.780
capacity when they need it.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:54.120
Presumed drowned after the wreck of the Queen's
Gambit, Sara Lance barely survives and is

00:04:54.130 --> 00:05:00.949
taken prisoner aboard the ship Amazo property
of the mad scientist Dr. Ivo, who trains Sara

00:05:00.949 --> 00:05:02.220
to become his assistant.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:07.880
After reuniting with her former lover Oliver
Queen and being presumed drowned a second

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:13.770
time, Sara is rescued by Nyssa al Ghul of
the League of Assassins and recruited into

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.680
the secret organization of silent killers.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.880
Nyssa and Sara soon become lovers.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.680
"I've had better greetings.”

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:24.200
“Sorry I just didn’t know what you were
going to do.”

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.120
“To be honest neither did I."

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:31.940
Sara has had both male and female partners
since returning to Star City on Arrow.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:36.500
She has also since become one of the regular
characters on Legends of Tomorrow, and took

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:41.599
over the Captain's chair of the series' central
time and space ship, the Waverider.and also

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:47.180
is in a long-term relationship with Ava Sharpe
a genetically engineered clone from the 23rd

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:47.920
century.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:55.360
The fourth season of the CW's Supergirl made
a huge stride in LGBTQ+ representation by

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.909
introducing TV's first transgender superhero.

00:05:57.909 --> 00:06:00.580
“I am both human and alien.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.680
And I am a transwoman.”

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:09.540
Nia Nal, also known as Dreamer, is a trans
woman of mixed human and alien heritage who

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:13.960
inherits her powers, which include being able
to see the future, after her mother's death.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:19.540
Nia's mother Isabel was from the planet Naltor,
and used the title of Dreamer before Nia.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:25.050
Naltorian Dreamers are women of extraordinary
abilities, including often receiving precognitive

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.320
visions in their dreams.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:32.080
A Naltorian Dreamer's power passes to her
daughters, so when Nia's mother dies, Nia

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:37.360
is initially confused about the Dreamer abilities
beginning to manifest in her because she wasn't

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.340
biologically born female.

00:06:39.729 --> 00:06:44.320
It soon becomes clear that Isabel always knew
it would be Nia, and not her sister Maeve,

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.879
who would inherit her powers.

00:06:45.879 --> 00:06:50.260
Sadly, while Nia's family has appeared to
be accepting towards her transgender identity

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:55.610
so far, the revelation that Maeve won't inherit
her mother's abilities causes a lot of ugliness

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:56.260
to come out.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.000
Meanwhile, Dreamer has been a close friend
and ally to Supergirl since obtaining her

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.330
abilities, and has also enjoyed a somewhat
rocky romantic relationship with Supergirl's

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.930
ally from the future, Brainy.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:12.760
The CW's Arrowverse consists of a vast multiverse
of various alternate realities.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:17.340
One of those realities is Earth-X, where the
Nazis won World War II.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:22.000
The Earth-X alternates of the Arrowverse's
heroes tend to be villains serving the Reich

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:27.780
on Earth-X: such as Overgirl instead of Supergirl,
and Dark Arrow rather than Green Arrow.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:34.500
In the 2017 CW crossover Crisis on Earth-X,
characters from The Flash, Arrow, Legends

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.520
of Tomorrow, and Supergirl are brought to
Earth-X.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:41.980
Most are freed from a concentration camp by
the Freedom Fighters made up of The Ray and

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.699
Leo Snart, also known as Citizen Cold.

00:07:44.699 --> 00:07:48.729
It soon becomes apparent that Ray and Leo
are in love, and that their relationship made

00:07:48.729 --> 00:07:50.300
them a target of the Nazis.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:55.400
In season 4 of The Flash, the heroes ask for
Snart's help in transporting a metahuman to

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:55.940
A.R.G.U.S.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:01.099
Upon arriving on Earth-1 and reuniting with
his old comrades, Leo is met with cheers and

00:08:01.099 --> 00:08:06.289
congratulations when he announces that back
on Earth-X, he and the Ray are planning to

00:08:06.289 --> 00:08:07.040
get married.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.620
October 2019 saw the premiere of CW's Batwoman.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:15.720
Set in the same narrative as "Arrowverse"
shows that include Arrow, The Flash, and Legends

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.680
of Tomorrow, the new series stars Ruby Rose
as the titular hero.

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:23.040
Behind the mask is Kate Kane, cousin to Bruce
Wayne.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.940
One of the more noteworthy differences between
Batwoman and other superhero TV shows and

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:33.340
movies is that, in a crowded field, Ruby Rose
is playing the first openly lesbian superhero

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:33.980
in a leading role.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:38.480
The character first shows up in the Arrowverse
in the 2018 crossover Elseworlds.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:43.480
In the following year's massive crossover,
Crisis on Infinite Earths, Batwoman takes

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:47.980
a prominent role in the conflict as the multiverse's
Paragon of Courage.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:54.190
This version of Batwoman was first introduced
in the comics toward the end of the 2005 line-wide

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:58.520
event Infinite Crisis, though at first fans
weren't sure who she was.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:03.640
She was soon given her own solo series and
became a prominent part of the Bat Family,

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.900
though Batwoman and Batman don't often get
along.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:12.480
Shortly after DC's 2016 relaunch, Batman invited
Batwoman to lead his new group of "Batmen,"

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:17.700
in Detective Comics, though he gave his cousin
her walking papers after she killed the reformed

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.700
villain Clayface.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:24.890
The first time the bisexuality of John Constantine, whose name should be pronounced

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:28.500
Constantine
if you're talking about the comics version,

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.220
“John Constantine.”

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.260
“Constantine.”

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:32.860
“Is it?

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:33.900
I don’t care.”

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:39.860
is brought up is in 1992's Hellblazer #51,
and the reveal doesn't come with a lot of

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:40.360
fanfare.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:46.580
Speaking of how he doesn't maintain many long-term
relationships, Constantine's narration reads:

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.520
"Girlfriends, the odd boyfriend...

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:51.480
They all have the nasty habit of walking out
on me."

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:59.260
Neither the 2005 film Constantine nor the
2014 TV series of the same name make any mention

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.200
of Constantine's bisexuality.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:06.880
But when Matt Ryan's version of Constantine
became part of CW's Arrowverse, his bisexuality

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.300
was explicitly addressed.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.080
Constantine becomes a recurring character
on Legends of Tomorrow in the show's third

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:17.700
season, and he is depicted in romantic situations
with both men and women.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:22.360
He and Sara Lance have a one-night stand,
and later it's revealed that he and the Time

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:25.680
Bureau goofball Gary have had some kind of
brief fling.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.420
"Yeah, Constantine let me down easy too..

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:31.160
Something about a balance between good and
evil."

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:36.040
Years earlier, Constantine was also in a relationship
with a male bartender named Desmond.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:41.580
In fact, Constantine is plagued with guilt
over memories of his old lover, who he was

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:45.300
forced to send to Hell in order to banish
the demon Neron from Earth.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:51.520
When the DC Universe streaming service revived
the Young Justice animated series, it included

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:55.880
the reveal that the show's new version of
Aquaman was in a same-sex relationship.

00:10:56.060 --> 00:11:01.780
Orin, the original Aquaman you may be more
familiar with, retires from all things "super,"

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:07.330
and Kaldur, formerly Aqualad, assumes the
name Aquaman as well as the leadership of

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:07.820
the Justice League.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:15.000
In Young Justice: Outsiders, Kaldur is depicted
as being in a same-sex relationship with the

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.440
Atlantean Wyynd.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:20.420
It isn't clear whether Kaldur identifies as
gay or bisexual.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:25.760
In earlier seasons of Young Justice, Kaldur
is shown to have romantic feelings for female

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:26.260
characters.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:31.140
In particular, while still using the name
Aqualad, Kaldur holds a torch for Tula, also

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:35.500
known as Aquagirl, and is heartbroken when
she gets involved with his best friend Tempest.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:40.200
It could be that he's bisexual, or that in
those earlier instances he hadn't yet come

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.250
to accept his sexuality.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:47.550
For a long time, it was one of DC Comics'
worst kept secrets that Harley Quinn was both

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:53.680
bisexual and in a non-monogamous relationship
with fellow Gotham City anti-hero Poison Ivy.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:59.690
They'd been friends and more in comics, cartoons,
and even video games for years trading innuendo

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:04.040
and hints all the time but for a long time
there was no official word on the pairing.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:09.740
But then Harley Quinn writers Jimmy Palmiotti
and Amanda Conner confirmed Harley and Ivy's

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:15.810
relationship status in 2015, and fans finally
got to see the pair share a kiss in 2017's

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.240
Harley Quinn #25.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:24.000
Harley was understandably devastated when
Poison Ivy died during the 2018/2019 DC miniseries

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:24.920
Heroes in Crisis.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:29.080
Thankfully, by the end of the series, it's
shown that Ivy had prepared for the potential

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.670
of her death by creating a plant-based clone
of herself who then goes on to team up with

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.520
Harley in the Harley Quinn &amp; Poison Ivy miniseries.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:42.170
In 1992, Marvel Comics made history with its
first openly gay superhero.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:48.730
In Alpha Flight #106, during a battle with
the World War II-era superhero Major Mapleleaf,

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.080
Northstar admits that he's gay.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:54.820
Shortly after the fight, he opens up to the
world at large, and his coming out is soon

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:57.100
on the front page of the Canadian newspapers.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:02.040
Northstar's visibility in Marvel Comics has
had its ups and downs ever since.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:05.320
He eventually left Alpha Flight for the more
well-known X-Men.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:11.560
Northstar was a teacher at Xavier's Institute
and was famously killed by a mind-controlled

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.550
Wolverine in 2005's Wolverine #25.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.720
He got better, and more recently, Northstar
and his sister Aurora joined the mutants of

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:25.200
Marvel on the island haven of Krakoa as part
of Marvel's Dawn of X storyline.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:30.400
Still, while he may not be a Marvel A-lister,
his 1992 coming out issue wasn't the last

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.880
time the character made history.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:36.800
Same-sex marriage became legal in the Marvel
Universe's New York and the real world in

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:42.200
2011, and Northstar and his partner Kyle were
wed in Marvel's first same-sex superhero nuptials

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.200
during 2012's Astonishing X-Men #51.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:51.360
In 2015, Marvel Comics readers learned that
Iceman, also known as Bobby Drake and one

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:56.620
of the original X-Men, was a gay man and the
reveal unfolded in a manner only a comic book

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.480
could pull off.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:02.470
When All-New X-Men was launched in 2012, the
title was more than a little ironic.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:07.680
The series opens with the original five X-men,
including Iceman, being brought from the time

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.960
of their origin into the present, while they're
still teenagers.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:17.100
So when the teenage Jean Grey takes the teen
Iceman aside in 2015's All-New X-Men #40 to

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:22.350
reveal that she knows he's gay, there is also
an older version of Iceman out there in the

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:24.840
world who has been dating women for his entire
adult life.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:30.080
In fact, part of the reason teen Iceman has
trouble accepting his sexuality is because

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.170
his older counterpart appears to be straight.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.860
How could he be gay if his future counterpart
isn't?

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:40.570
In Uncanny X-Men #600, the adult Bobby is
confronted by the younger versions of Iceman

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.540
and Jean Grey, and admits he's been in the
closet for years.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:48.880
Since coming out, Iceman has enjoyed a number
of short-lived solo series, and took on an

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.980
important role helping oppressed mutants escape
to Krakoa in Marauders.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:58.080
Like Harley Quinn, Renee Montoya made her
first appearance not in the comics, but in

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.800
the '90s cartoon Batman: The Animated Series.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:05.480
But it would be over a decade before the former
Gotham detective would become a bona fide

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:05.980
superhero.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:11.760
Montoya's first appearance in the comics was
in 1992's Batman #475, in which she is introduced

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.700
working with Harvey Bullock inside Gotham's
Major Crimes Unit.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:21.280
She then stepped into the spotlight in 2002
with Gotham Central a comic focusing on the

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.860
Gotham City Police Department.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:28.680
Fed up with the force's corruption, Montoya
quits the GCPD and falls on hard times.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.760
She drinks habitually and loses her girlfriend
Daria.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:36.820
The vigilante Vic Sage, also known as the
Question, then recruits Montoya during the

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:41.100
series 52 to help him fight the criminal organization
Intergang.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:45.810
By the time that series is over, Sage has
succumbed to cancer and Montoya has taken

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:47.140
up the mantle of the Question.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:51.880
Despite a few revamps and reboots here and
there, Montoya has remained the Question in

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.400
the comics.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:57.600
More recently, Montoya has helped Superman's
wife in the espionage thriller miniseries

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.300
Lois Lane.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:03.780
Rosie Perez brought Montoya to life
in the 2020 film Birds of Prey, and remaining

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.700
comic accurate her character was indeed a
lesbian.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.800
America Chavez is a lesbian raised by a gay
couple and she's also one of Marvel's most

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.020
powerful superheroes.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:19.470
She's super strong, she can fly, she has super
speed, and she's nearly invulnerable.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:26.020
And when her series America launched in 2017,
she became the first LGBTQ+ person of color

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:29.560
to lead her own ongoing title in the history
of Marvel Comics.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:35.060
Originally known as Miss America - based on
the character of the same name from the 1940s

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:40.560
- the present America... (the character) first
appearing in the 2011 miniseries Vengeance,

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:45.790
Chavez gained a lot more attention as a member
of the Young Avengers and during the 2015

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:49.860
line-wide event Secret Wars, when she was
part of the all-female A-Force.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:55.060
Along with her solo series, America joined
the Ultimates and eventually became the team's

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:55.560
leader.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:17:00.060
More recently, she was part of a new incarnation
of the West Coast Avengers, led by the group's

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.660
founding member Hawkeye.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:07.379
The heroes Hulkling and Wiccan enjoy one of
the longest-running same-sex relationships

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:07.920
in comics.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:12.500
They were introduced in Young Avengers #1,
when both the heroes seemed to be younger

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:16.880
versions of the classic Avengers line-up,
whose origins were shrouded in mystery.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:21.370
What's particularly interesting is the actual
characters these two were based on.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.600
Hulkling, as his codename suggests, looks
like a younger and smaller version of the

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.100
Hulk.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.720
Wiccan, on the other hand, goes by the name
"Asgardian" when he's introduced, suggesting

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.780
a connection to Thor.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:36.620
So it was particularly interesting to base
these two young gay men on heroes who are

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.800
known to regularly beat the tar out of one
another.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:43.480
But in the end, neither Hulkling nor Wiccan
proved to have any significant connection

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.300
to those classic Avengers.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:50.340
Hulkling's physical appearance is due to his
mixed Skrull and Kree ancestry, and has nothing

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.120
to do with gamma rays.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:56.900
Wiccan, meanwhile, eventually learns he's
one of the twin sons born to the mutant Scarlet

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.320
Witch and the android hero Vision.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:03.840
Hulkling and Wiccan have never strayed far
from the spotlight of Marvel Comics since

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:04.500
their introduction.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:09.740
Both recently appeared in the 2019 Death's
Head miniseries, and Wiccan is one of the

00:18:09.759 --> 00:18:14.809
members of the new team Strikeforce, which
includes a number of occult-themed or otherwise

00:18:14.809 --> 00:18:18.980
non-traditional heroes such as Blade, the
Winter Soldier and Angela.

